Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.48,Nickel,,0,0,0,,Nickel: Pillow! What's going on, here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:04.90,Pillow,,0,0,0,,I'm teaching Cake and Book how to play "Yoyle Chess."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:08.04,Cake,,0,0,0,,Yeah Nickel, it's really REALLY fun to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:11.03,Cake,,0,0,0,,Here, when this game ends, you can play me next!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.03,0:00:14.12,Book,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait--I thought I was next in line!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:19.23,Nickel,,0,0,0,,Nickel: Oh, sure, that would be fun. But then--why are we playing on TOP OF THIS LIFE-THREATENING ROLLER COASTER!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.23,0:00:22.13,Yellow Face,,0,0,0,,Yellow Face: He HE! Time for some fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:28.34,Cake,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, I don't know why we're here. Pillow was just about to explain to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.04,Cake,,0,0,0,,She is the expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.04,0:00:32.02,Cake,,0,0,0,,{\rCake}Cake: Yeah, Pillow--why do we have to play--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:32.78,Multiple Speakers,,0,0,0,,{\rCake}Cake: Yeah, Pillow--why do we have to play--\N{\rPillow}Pillow: CAR!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:35.00,Yellow Face,,0,0,0,,TEHEHEHEHEHE!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.05,0:00:38.80,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Nickel screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:44.28,Book,,0,0,0,,Whew! That was so scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:46.98,Book,,0,0,0,,Yoyle Chess sure is an exhilarating game!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.98,0:00:49.59,Book,,0,0,0,,Say, where did Nickel go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:51.36,Pillow,,0,0,0,,Pillow: He questioned the rules of "Yoyle Chess."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.44,SFX,,0,0,0,,[vine boom]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:54.78,Pillow,,0,0,0,,Nobody questions the rules of "Yoyle Chess."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[vine boom x2]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.67,0:00:58.03,Cake,,0,0,0,,If you say so, Pillow--WHA?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.03,0:01:01.61,Cake,,0,0,0,,Why are ALL MY PIECES SUDDENLY ON THE WEAKEST SQUARES?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.62,0:01:04.40,Cake,,0,0,0,,Cake: Pillow, are you sure you put the pieces back in the right places--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:05.09,Multiple Speakers,,0,0,0,,{\rCake}Cake: Pillow, are you sure you put the pieces back in the right places--\N{\rPillow}Pillow: CAR!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:06.50,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Nickel screams, then grunts.]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:07.15,Two,,0,0,0,,OOH!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:07.93,Two,,0,0,0,,OOH! Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.93,0:01:08.56,Two,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.56,0:01:09.52,Two,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to buy a juicy gumball—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:10.65,Two,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to buy a juicy gumball from this gumball machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:12.31,Two,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't afford it until now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.31,0:01:13.02,Two,,0,0,0,,I'm rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:13.98,Two,,0,0,0,,I'm rich! I'M RICH!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:14.31,Two,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:15.25,Two,,0,0,0,,{\t(0,1000,\fscx120\fscy120)}I'm RIIIIIIIIIIIIICCCH!!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.25,0:01:15.98,Two,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\t(0,1500,\fscx350\fscy350)\fad(0,500)}I'm RIIIIIIIIIIIIICCCH!!!!!
