Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:43.56,Two (Muffled),,0,0,0,,[Muffled] So in case you forgot, last time, our seven teams tried making their best amusement park rides!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.56,0:01:47.34,Two (Muffled),,0,0,0,,[Muffled] The S! and Team8s ended up with the lowest ratings with zero out of ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:53.64,Two (Muffled),,0,0,0,,[Muffled] So they're both up for elimination! Whichever members on each team got the fewest viewer votes will leave the battle for the Power of Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.63,0:01:57.82,Fries,,0,0,0,,Two, spit out that gum! It's time to be a respectable host!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.82,0:01:59.01,Two (Muffled),,0,0,0,,[Chewing] Oh, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.01,0:02:00.01,Two (Muffled),,0,0,0,,[Chewing] You have a good point!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.31,0:02:05.00,Two,,0,0,0,,There, now that'll never be a problem we'll have to deal with ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.01,0:02:06.65,Bottle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I have a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.64,0:02:10.62,Bottle,,0,0,0,,Let's do Cake at Stake on The S! stage we built last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:13.29,Two,,0,0,0,,Two: That's a lovely idea, Bottle! We must do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.29,0:02:16.18,Two,,0,0,0,,Everyone, welcome to the grand opening of--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.18,0:02:18.67,Two,,0,0,0,,--the new Cake at Stake stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:21.66,Bottle,,0,0,0,,Alrighty then, S-ers! Let's get on stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:22.41,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Record scratch]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.41,0:02:25.31,Two,,0,0,0,,That's a terrible idea, Bottle! We mustn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:28.21,Bottle,,0,0,0,,{\rSFX}[Sad music]{\r}\NWha--why--why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.94,Clock,,0,0,0,,Clock: How are your tears flowing INSIDE the bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:32.46,Two,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Bottle, it's simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:39.66,Two,,0,0,0,,The reason you can't come on stage yet because Team8s technically did worse than your team because you at least built a stage, and they didn't make anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:41.95,Two,,0,0,0,,So as a punishment, they're gonna lose a member first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:48.57,Bottle,,0,0,0,,Oh! That makes sense! Anyway Two, let's give the Team8s the best Cake at Stake ceremony ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:52.48,Two,,0,0,0,,Let's do it. Gramophone, we've been training for this for weeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.49,0:02:54.64,Two,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to shine now. HIT IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.10,0:02:55.90,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\ytktFade}{\kf11}Hey {\kf50}Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:57.35,Song,,0,0,0,,{\ytktFade}{\kf24}When {\kf17}you {\kf15}bake {\kf12}a {\kf66}cake
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.35,0:03:00.10,Song,,0,0,0,,{\ytktFade}{\kf25}Dec{\kf17}o{\kf12}rate {\kf13}and {\kf30}take {\kf15}it {\kf21}to {\kf15}the {\kf17}play{\kf17}ers {\kf25}who {\kf12}are {\kf40}safe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:04.50,Song,,0,0,0,,{\ytktFade}{\kf23}That's {\kf37}how {\kf17}you {\kf17}know {\kf16}it's {\kf42}Cake {\kf43}at {\kf175}Stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:07.20,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,750)\ytktFade}{\kf31}Cake {\kf34}At {\kf25}Stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:10.28,Barf Bag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}Oh, wow! I'm loving that new Cake at Stake jingle, Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.28,0:03:13.09,Two,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Barfy! I figured new stage, new song!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:15.71,Two,,0,0,0,,Also, this episode's cakes are delicious burritos!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.71,0:03:21.29,Two,,0,0,0,,They're smart, creative, not overly dramatic, they'll listen to your problems, and they love writing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.29,0:03:22.98,Gaty,,0,0,0,,Gaty: What impressive burritos!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:25.92,Pin,,0,0,0,,Pin: How are you all being so optimistic right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.92,0:03:30.01,Pin,,0,0,0,,Our team is in danger! One of us will be exterminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:34.02,Donut,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, Pin! Whatever doesn't kill you makes you stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.03,0:03:41.46,Donut,,0,0,0,,And also I'm speaking right now because statistics show whoever speaks right before Two announces the votes has the highest chance of getting cake first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:43.65,Pin,,0,0,0,,Pin: E--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.65,0:03:43.90,Multiple Speakers,,0,0,0,,{\rPin}Pin: E--\N{\rTwo}Two: PIN IS SAFE with–
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.90,0:03:46.75,Two,,0,0,0,,Two: PIN IS SAFE with–
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:49.05,Two (votes),,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs239.2\pos(1323.3,476)}votes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:48.51,Donut,,0,0,0,,Donut: Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.51,0:03:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.05,0:03:52.74,Two,,0,0,0,,Also safe are Coiny, Barf Bag, Gaty, and Needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:57.31,Saw,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Donut! It looks like FATE has caught up to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:04:00.44,Donut,,0,0,0,,Yeah...it's either you or I leaving today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:04.20,Two,,0,0,0,,And the answer is that, well, Saw, you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.19,0:04:06.25,Two,,0,0,0,,You fell a few votes short of Donut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.25,0:04:08.43,Saw,,0,0,0,,Aww... that's not GREAT!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:11.72,Saw,,0,0,0,,I'll always cherish building that restaurant with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.72,0:04:18.02,Saw,,0,0,0,,But Two, just curious, how many votes was I short of Donut by? Perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:19.00,Saw,,0,0,0,,Eight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.60,0:04:21.84,Two,,0,0,0,,Two: Yeah, actually. It's exactly eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.85,0:04:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:23.09,Two,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.09,0:04:25.48,Two,,0,0,0,,"The S!", you're up for elimination next.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:29.16,Two,,0,0,0,,Just like Team8s, whichever one of you got the fewest votes is eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.17,0:04:32.76,Yellow Face,,0,0,0,,It's so awesome to finally be on stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:38.32,Two,,0,0,0,,Yellow Face! You just spoke, so you're safe with 8,744 votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.32,0:04:41.37,Two,,0,0,0,,So is Winner, Rocky, Clock and Bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.37,0:04:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.87,0:04:45.95,Bottle,,0,0,0,,Hehe, soggy burritos! My favorite concoction!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.94,0:04:53.35,Cloudy,,0,0,0,,Well it's down to just you and me, Ice Cube! Water based contestants have it so hard these days!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.35,0:04:53.95,Ice Cube,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.95,0:04:58.21,Fries,,0,0,0,,It's probably because you evaporate too easily! Just stop doing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.21,0:05:02.53,Two,,0,0,0,,Two: Shhh! Fries, you're made with obscene amounts of oil, so you're not much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:05.26,Two,,0,0,0,,Two: Anyway, the person eliminated is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:07.41,Two,,0,0,0,,Two: Cloudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:12.04,Two,,0,0,0,,Two: You came 900 votes short of Ice Cube, which means, you're gone, like a puff of smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:15.98,Cloudy,,0,0,0,,Aw man, I'm sad I wasn't able to stay longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:22.74,Cloudy,,0,0,0,,But, I'm happy I was at least able to collect so many nice memories with this team, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:24.41,Cloudy,,0,0,0,,Cloudy: Bye everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.41,0:05:25.46,Two,,0,0,0,,Bye, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:29.01,The S!,,0,0,0,,The S!: Holy cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:32.78,Pin,,0,0,0,,Man, it's a real bummer that Saw's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.78,0:05:37.90,Needle,,0,0,0,,I agree! It was really fun getting to know her, she had a sharp wit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:39.94,Pin,,0,0,0,,Yeah! #TeamSharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:44.92,Pin,,0,0,0,,And one time, Saw and I even smelled this Funny Plant together. It was the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:48.89,Coiny,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could use this plant as a shrine to remember her memory then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:50.29,Pin,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:55.75,Gaty,,0,0,0,,Yeah, even more so because, I know of species of flower has 3 lives. I learned that in gardening class.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:57.56,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Cake screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:05:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.43,0:06:01.46,Bottle,,0,0,0,,Teeheee! Chase the gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:03.07,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Popping sound]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:04.17,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Loud thud]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:07.47,Bottle,,0,0,0,,Teehee, gum bubble! Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.46,0:06:09.23,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Loud thud]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:14.97,Bottle,,0,0,0,,No! My soggy burrito concoction!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:17.46,Pin,,0,0,0,,NO! My friend Saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:19.58,Bottle,,0,0,0,,She isn't dead, y'know? She's only eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:21.47,Pin,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. No big deal, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.47,0:06:27.04,Fanny,,0,0,0,,Yes big deal! That was last specimen of the 'Funny Plant' alive on this planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:31.72,Fanny,,0,0,0,,Now that we've made the species go extinct, we've ruined the biodiversity of Goiky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:38.80,Two,,0,0,0,,No need to worry, Fanny! They are actually 7 specimen of the Funny Plants still alive now in different biomes across the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:41.42,Two,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, they're all down to their last life!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.41,0:06:48.64,Two,,0,0,0,,So they desperately need protection, which is why today's challenge is to pick a biome out of a hat and then protect that biome's Funny Plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:51.08,Remote,,0,0,0,,What biome did you get, Marker?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:52.23,Marker,,0,0,0,,Jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:55.98,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Hmmm... it shouldn't be too hard to protect a flower in a jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:07:01.75,Marker,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we're experts at preventing death these days!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:04.98,Snowball,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Snowy Tundra! Just like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.97,0:07:07.90,Basketball,,0,0,0,,Snow tundra? How can flower grow in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.90,0:07:09.71,Basketball,,0,0,0,,Oh no...we're doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:12.63,Eggy,,0,0,0,,You peeked inside the hat, did you, Snowball?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.63,0:07:13.58,Snowball,,0,0,0,,...maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:14.52,Eggy,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.52,0:07:15.53,Winner,,0,0,0,,Let's see what we got!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:16.67,Winner,,0,0,0,,"Outer space?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.38,Multiple Speakers,,0,0,0,,Winner: This isn't good!\NIce Cube: Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:25.28,Coiny,,0,0,0,,Team8s, we are going--to Yoyleland? Whoa! I'm feeling deja vu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:27.71,Donut,,0,0,0,,Ooh, but it'll be my first time there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:34.44,Book,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look...oh! I hope you guys got enough water stored up because our Funny Plant is in the desert!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:37.33,Cake,,0,0,0,,Awesome! We can play Yoyle Chess by the cacti!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.33,0:07:39.41,Pillow,,0,0,0,,That's against Yoyle Chess rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.41,0:07:44.30,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,My team, we're going to the biome of--eh--Davidland?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:46.60,Eraser,,0,0,0,,Aw, seriously? Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:51.45,Tennis Ball,,0,0,0,,Don't say that, it's already bringing back horrifying memories from my past!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:56.81,Pen,,0,0,0,,I didn't know Davidland was a biome! I just figured it was like, a congregation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:07:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.31,0:07:59.23,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Loud boom]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:02.72,Barf Bag,,0,0,0,,Um, Two? How are we going to get to our biomes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.72,0:08:05.91,Two,,0,0,0,,Good question. I definitely don't want to tire your little leggies out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:09.42,Two,,0,0,0,,So last week I commissioned Golf Ball to build these bracelets!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:16.09,Tennis Ball,,0,0,0,,Wow! Last time helmets and this time bracelets? You're really getting into wearable tech!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:17.35,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,I sure am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:21.32,Barf Bag,,0,0,0,,A silly bracelet? How's this going to help my team get to Yoyleland?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.32,0:08:22.17,Two,,0,0,0,,Two: Try it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.97,0:08:29.47,Barf Bag,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Purple grass? Yellow sky? There's no way I'm...I'm actually in Yoyleland!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.47,0:08:33.69,Barf Bag,,0,0,0,,Gaty, remember when I told you this was my lifelong travel destination?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.69,0:08:35.86,Barf Bag,,0,0,0,,Well, we're finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:38.88,Barf Bag,,0,0,0,,Wait, Gaty? Gaty? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:42.91,Barf Bag,,0,0,0,,Oh no, don't tell me I got lost! HELP!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:44.39,Pin,,0,0,0,,Pin: OMPF!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:47.80,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,Just take off the bracelet if you want to come home, Barf Bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.81,0:08:48.55,Barf Bag,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.55,0:08:53.88,Basketball,,0,0,0,,Oh. Hey Golf Ball, would you like to be invited to my brand new shape hater club?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.89,0:08:55.71,Basketball,,0,0,0,,Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:09:02.40,Two,,0,0,0,,So teams, use Golf Ball's bracelets to teleport to your biome, and then protect your funny plant at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:05.80,Two,,0,0,0,,First two teams whose plants die will be up for elimination!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:11.83,Two,,0,0,0,,Also, if you kill any of the seven funny plants yourself, your team automatically loses! GO!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:15.40,Tree,,0,0,0,,Hey Two, thanks for picking a challenge that protects plant life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:16.87,Two,,0,0,0,,You're welcome Treeyee!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.87,0:09:19.16,Tree,,0,0,0,,We botanical contestants appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.15,0:09:21.47,Multiple Speakers,,0,0,0,,Grassy: Like Grassy!\NTree: Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:23.20,Robot Flower,,0,0,0,,And Robot Flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:27.21,Tree,,0,0,0,,Y--uh, yeah? I--actually don't know if you count...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:29.48,Two,,0,0,0,,Enough squabbling! Now it's time to get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:30.63,Tree,,0,0,0,,Huh? Ugh--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:33.27,Tree,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I fit right in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.06,0:09:35.57,Tree,,0,0,0,,Thanks for joining me here, team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:41.56,Marker,,0,0,0,,Sure thing! Just like me, jungles are so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:42.61,Fanny,,0,0,0,,I HATE JUNGLES!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:44.32,Marker,,0,0,0,,Agree to disagree!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:49.28,Remote,,0,0,0,,Wow, this jungle has so many exotic plants, vines, orchids, and cherries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:51.81,Cherry Jr.,,0,0,0,,Oh hi, hi! It's me, "Cherry Jr. the orphan!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.81,0:09:55.84,Remote,,0,0,0,,Surprising. I thought the jungle was too humid for cherry trees to grow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:57.92,Cherry Jr.,,0,0,0,,It is! That's why I'm an orphan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:10:02.60,Lightning,,0,0,0,,And there's the funny plant we need to protect. Oh my cloud, it's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:04.18,Lightning,,0,0,0,,[Zap]\NLightning: Oh geez, whoops!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:07.60,Lightning Cherry,,0,0,0,,Ouchie, ouchie! I'm transforming into Lightning Cherry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.51,0:10:12.62,Remote,,0,0,0,,My sensors detect that the funny plant is down to 15% health.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:17.87,Tree,,0,0,0,,Oh my acorn... so soon and our precious baby is already nearly dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:20.67,Lightning,,0,0,0,,I know. I'm really sorry that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.67,0:10:22.68,Fanny,,0,0,0,,I HATE YOU BEING HERE IN THE JUNGLE!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:28.43,Black Hole,,0,0,0,,Fanny's right! Lightning, no hard feelings but, our team would be better off preventing death if you stayed back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:30.47,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Wait, no! I'm sure I can be more careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.47,0:10:31.58,Marker,,0,0,0,,Marker: I agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.58,0:10:33.01,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Lightning: No, no, no--NO NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.01,0:10:34.70,Marker,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:38.31,Snowball,,0,0,0,,Haha! I'm right in my element!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:44.56,Eggy,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I can't believe we have to protect this flimsy flower in the frigid cold just because of Snowball's dumb ego!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:47.43,Snowball,,0,0,0,,Ego? You're--you're the "eggo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:52.09,Basketball,,0,0,0,,Eggy's right. This flower's vitals are falling as we speak. Is there anything we can do to warm it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.09,0:10:56.85,Bell,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! Sound waves generate heat and I'm a master of making sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.85,0:10:58.05,Basketball,,0,0,0,,Good idea. Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:59.35,Eggy,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's do it, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:05.49,Bell,,0,0,0,,Warm up! Warm up! Every petal shred the ice! Warm up! Warm up! Get up toasty hot and nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:08.83,Bell,,0,0,0,,Warm up! Warm up! Every petal shred the ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:11.94,Basketball,,0,0,0,,It's working! It's WORKING! Keep it up Bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:15.38,Cake,,0,0,0,,Hmm... I'm gonna move my truck piece-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:18.88,Book,,0,0,0,,It's not called a truck piece, it's called a Freesmart supervan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:23.63,Cake,,0,0,0,,Okay...my Freesmart supervan. I'll move it...here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:25.38,Pillow,,0,0,0,,Ha HAH! Right into my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:30.03,Nickel,,0,0,0,,Are you guys seriously playing Yoyle Chess when we have this funny plant to protect?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:33.12,Pillow,,0,0,0,,Yoyle Chess is fun. Babysitting a plant is not fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.12,0:11:35.08,Book,,0,0,0,,No, Pillow. Nickel is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:35.92,Nickel,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.93,0:11:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:40.03,Naily,,0,0,0,,This plant is getting really dry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:43.07,Price Tag,,0,0,0,,Let's split up and search across the desert for water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:44.52,Book,,0,0,0,,Good plan, Price Tag!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:49.90,Eraser,,0,0,0,,So, um--Tennis bro? Where's Golf girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:53.50,Tennis Ball,,0,0,0,,She... already used her bracelet to get to Davidland.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.51,0:11:56.85,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Then let's put on our bracelets and join her there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:58.96,Tennis Ball,,0,0,0,,Uh.. actually Puffball.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:00.83,Puffball,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.83,0:12:08.69,Tennis Ball,,0,0,0,,Because you caused such a havoc last time with your deadly rollercoaster, Golf Ball instructed me to...ban you from participating this time..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.69,0:12:10.70,Puffball,,0,0,0,,But I still want to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:13.37,Tennis Ball,,0,0,0,,Sorry Puffball, it's just protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.37,0:12:19.35,Tennis Ball,,0,0,0,,But to you other Are You Okayers, equip your bracelets and let's head off to Davidland!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:23.42,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Hey bud, your team left you behind too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:24.37,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Yeaaaaaah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.37,0:12:27.31,Lightning,,0,0,0,,They must have a thing against us flying contestants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:28.78,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Puffball: Maybe they do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.77,0:12:31.26,Clock,,0,0,0,,Clock: Team S! Let's head off to outer space!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.26,0:12:32.28,Ice Cube,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:38.39,Clock,,0,0,0,,Clock: Oh, but uh...not you Ice Cube. You're made of water so you might sublimate in a vacuum. Better stay here on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.39,0:12:39.13,Ice Cube,,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:41.32,Clock,,0,0,0,,Sorry Icy. It's for your own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.31,0:12:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:47.82,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Wow Ice Cube, you too? These teams are abandoning their members left and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.81,0:12:49.87,Ice Cube,,0,0,0,,I want revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.87,0:12:56.44,Puffball,,0,0,0,,It's okay to feel that way Ice Cube. At least the three of us understand what it feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:13:03.49,Bell,,0,0,0,,[Singing] Warm warm warm! You still stay toasty and healthy! Warm warm warm, you will stay toasty and healthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:06.52,Basketball,,0,0,0,,Keep going Bell! This funny plant looks like its almost at full health!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:11.24,Bell,,0,0,0,,Grow big and strong plant! Grow...big and strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:13.41,Bell,,0,0,0,,Team members? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.41,0:13:16.97,Eggy,,0,0,0,,Oh great. Bell lost her bracelet, she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.97,0:13:21.52,Robot Flower,,0,0,0,,We gotta get her back! Can we give her a call with Touch-Tone telephone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:25.38,Robot Flower,,0,0,0,,Maybe their landline connection can work across biome borders!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:32.77,Eggy,,0,0,0,,I don't think so Robot Flower. I love Touch-Tone's aesthetic, but Bell doesn't strike me as the type of girl to be wired up all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:36.16,Basketball,,0,0,0,,Basketball: And our funny plant is already starting to freeze again. We need a plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.16,0:13:42.67,Robot Flower,,0,0,0,,But, it's so desolate here! What objects on this mountain could even be used to generate heat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.67,0:13:46.56,Snowball,,0,0,0,,I suddenly have an idea in mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.07,0:13:49.15,Grassy,,0,0,0,,I'm...Grassy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:52.49,Yellow Face,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We're in space now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:56.73,Winner,,0,0,0,,Whoa! I never would have guessed that we'd get these nifty space pods!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:13:59.04,Bottle,,0,0,0,,That's awesome, because look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.04,0:14:04.55,Bottle,,0,0,0,,That super-distant Quasar is about to shoot a deadly gamma ray in our direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:06.22,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Loud laser sound]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.23,0:14:13.07,Bottle,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe! See, because of the protective space pod, that just tickled. Take that, Quasar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.07,0:14:17.73,Clock,,0,0,0,,Ugh...uh...I don't know, Bottle. Gamma ray bursts make me feel a little nauseous...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.73,0:14:19.59,Yellow Face,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Rocky too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.59,0:14:21.13,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Vomit noise]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:23.02,Yellow Face,,0,0,0,,Now he's drowning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:29.11,Bottle,,0,0,0,,Rocky drowning IS sad news, but our Funny Plant thriving in space is happy news!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:35.04,Winner,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at the earth! I can see Yoyleland from here! I wonder, what's going on down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.03,0:14:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.03,0:14:41.48,Coiny,,0,0,0,,Well Team8s, here we are, at the glorious expanse of Yoyleland!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:48.48,Barf Bag,,0,0,0,,Gasp! The world's famous Yoyle bush! And what's this? A ripe Yoyleberry? Prime for plucking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.48,0:14:50.16,Needle,,0,0,0,,Wait, Barf Bag, don't--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:58.48,Barf Bag,,0,0,0,,Don't worry Needle, I wasn't gonna eat it. Besides, it's worth more than it's weight in gold to collectors, so I'll just save it as a souvenir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.47,0:15:04.88,Gaty,,0,0,0,,But Barf Bag, the only collector who wants it that badly isn't here with us anymore, so he can't even buy it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:07.16,Barf Bag,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are you---oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:10.60,Pin,,0,0,0,,Anyway Team8-ers, here's our funny plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:18.27,Pin,,0,0,0,,The cool thing is Yoyle soil is very fertile, so the Funny Plant should have no problem thriving here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.26,0:15:21.79,Donut,,0,0,0,,Fascinating! I can see it growing in real time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.80,0:15:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:23.97,Donut,,0,0,0,,OMB!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:29.23,Coiny,,0,0,0,,Wow, Pin! Between this and your knowledge of Yoyleseeds, you seem to know a lot about plants!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.22,0:15:33.35,Pin,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm just obsessed with reading about Yoyle biology!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.47,0:15:43.05,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,Well, Are You Okayers, we're back in the depths of Davidland!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:44.48,Tennis Ball,,0,0,0,,I remember it well!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:45.23,Fries,,0,0,0,,So do I!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:53.82,Pen,,0,0,0,,Well, it's my first time here and I'm kind of spooked! I remember David from season one but why are these Davids so much bigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:16:00.99,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,Silly Pen! Most Davids are this size. The David we saw way back then was simply a smaller variant of the species!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.99,0:16:07.42,Tennis Ball,,0,0,0,,OMTBF! I found our Funny Plant that we have to save--but why is it close to one of the Davids' legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:10.60,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,Wh--Wait, this is actually a serious problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.61,0:16:15.81,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,TV, calculate the reverberation rate of a large-sized David saying "Aw, seriously".
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:23.82,Fries,,0,0,0,,Oh no, 2,763 reverberation units? That's so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.82,0:16:29.29,Fries,,0,0,0,,How tragic! No I actually have no clue what that means. Is that a big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:36.44,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a big deal, Fries! Remember the Davids will say "Aw seriously" if you provoke them, which you did last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:41.48,Fries,,0,0,0,,It's about time, Davids are the most annoying creatures I have ever laid my eyes upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:42.99,David,,0,0,0,,Davids: Aw, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:48.39,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,When we were a mile up, their "Aw, seriouslies" sounded at a moderate volume.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.39,0:16:53.74,Tennis Ball,,0,0,0,,But here on ground level, it will sound so loud, it'll probably rupture all our eardrums!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:57.36,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,And worse, the reverberation will destroy the funny plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.36,0:17:00.48,Eraser,,0,0,0,,Haha! You finished each other's sentences!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:08.39,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,This is serious, Eraser! It means we can't utter a single insult to the Davids, or else they'll hear, and we'll lose this challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.39,0:17:12.61,Fries,,0,0,0,,Oh no! You mean I can't even say that the Davids look like absolute---
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:14.65,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,No! You can't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:21.82,Eraser,,0,0,0,,Haha! That reminds me of the time I was thinking of going up to a David and---
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:22.48,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,Golf Ball: NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.48,0:17:28.47,Pen,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Golf Ball! I know exactly what you mean. I shouldn't say the fact that Davids are truly---
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.47,0:17:29.54,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,Tennis Ball, HELP!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:31.83,Tennis Ball,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes! Doing my duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.83,0:17:38.51,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Ominous sounds]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.51,0:17:39.50,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,Phew!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:41.18,Naily,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, Bomby! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.19,0:17:42.10,Bomby,,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:45.02,Naily,,0,0,0,,I have an idea. Are you cool with dying for this challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.02,0:17:46.73,Multiple Speakers,,0,0,0,,Bomby: Sure!\NNaily: YAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:49.62,Bomby,,0,0,0,,Whooooah! Oh my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.62,0:17:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.67,0:17:56.34,Naily,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Cactuses have water inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.34,0:17:58.04,Pillow,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Naily!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:18:00.74,Naily,,0,0,0,,Funny plant, time to quench your thirst!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.29,0:18:04.43,Naily,,0,0,0,,Yay! I nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:07.82,Price Tag,,0,0,0,,I found a fancy water bottle. It was in the side of an abandoned van.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.82,0:18:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.20,0:18:10.84,Price Tag,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:15.19,Nickel,,0,0,0,,Well, I found an even fancier water bottle in the side of an even more abandoned van!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.19,0:18:16.54,Water Bottle,,0,0,0,,You sure did!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:18.04,Nickel,,0,0,0,,Wait, what--you can talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:23.51,Water Bottle,,0,0,0,,I sure can! And it's not an even more abandoned van, it's my home sweet mobile home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.51,0:18:28.42,Nickel,,0,0,0,,Nickel: Got it! Hey, uhhh--can I pour your innards on this funny plant? We need to win this challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:33.36,Water Bottle,,0,0,0,,Oh sure! I've always wanted to use my sparkling water for something useful, so go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.36,0:18:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:37.05,Nickel,,0,0,0,,Thanks, talking water bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.05,0:18:38.07,Water Bottle,,0,0,0,,No problem, Nickel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.07,0:18:45.87,Book,,0,0,0,,I didn't find any water, but I'm a motivational quote pamphlet, so I looked up a few inspiring words to say to the plant...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:48.80,Book,,0,0,0,,Book: "It's hard to beat a plant who never gives up growing!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:51.49,Book,,0,0,0,,No way, that worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:55.73,Price Tag,,0,0,0,,So that means we've got everybody except, uhh...Bomby?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.73,0:18:57.36,Naily,,0,0,0,,I exploded him intentionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.36,0:18:59.73,Price Tag,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's fair. Wait, and Cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.73,0:19:06.14,Nickel,,0,0,0,,Uh oh, umm...I hope we reminded Cake to avoid that ancient Yellow Face skeleton that died in BFDIA, 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:08.07,Book,,0,0,0,,Oh my word! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:10.46,Naily,,0,0,0,,We definitely didn't remind him about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:12.99,Pillow,,0,0,0,,This is my first time caring about this skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.99,0:19:15.23,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Loud boom]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:20.02,Cake,,0,0,0,,Cake: Where is it? I can't find any water! Maybe there's some behind here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:25.27,Cake,,0,0,0,,Cake: No. Hmmm.... Where could it be, where could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.27,0:19:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:29.34,Lightning,,0,0,0,,So, what do we do now? Wanna play charades?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.34,0:19:33.23,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Not really. I still want to convince my team I can contribute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.23,0:19:36.38,Lightning,,0,0,0,,I mean, I agree, but what can either of us really do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:39.20,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Don't you still have your jungle bracelet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:45.06,Lightning,,0,0,0,,This thing? Oh yeah, I do. I guess when Marker pulled it off my arm, both me and the bracelet got sent home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.06,0:19:48.61,Puffball,,0,0,0,,So why don't you put it back on again and help your team compete?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.61,0:19:58.73,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Uh, I dunno. They meant to kick me out, and I don't want to over-insist too much. Like, I wouldn't want to attend a party I wasn't invited to, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:19:59.83,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Well, I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.83,0:20:00.61,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Puffball munch]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.61,0:20:01.36,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:04.01,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Why are you coming for my bracelet? This is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.01,0:20:10.04,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Come on, TPOT's more fun when we get to shake it up! You don't want to go to the jungle, so I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:11.97,Lightning,,0,0,0,,That doesn't warrant stealing though!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.97,0:20:12.47,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Puffball munch]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.47,0:20:13.16,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.71,0:20:14.32,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Puffball munch]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:15.05,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:15.78,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Puffball munch]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.77,0:20:16.55,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.37,0:20:17.98,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Puffball munch]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.98,0:20:18.62,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.62,0:20:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.34,0:20:21.88,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Huh, I gotta be smarter about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:22.62,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:23.54,Bell,,0,0,0,,Bell: Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.54,0:20:26.88,Puffball,,0,0,0,,[Bell screams]\NPuffball: Let's ride my rollercoaster, Bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:29.23,Bell,,0,0,0,,I hate rollercoasters though!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.21,0:20:31.67,Puffball,,0,0,0,,It'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:33.93,Bell,,0,0,0,,Bell: I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.93,0:20:40.75,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Bell screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:41.45,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.45,0:20:42.32,Lightning,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.57,0:20:46.64,Marker,,0,0,0,,WAAH?! What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:50.09,Remote,,0,0,0,,It's Puffball. She's not a Death P.A.C.T. Again member though!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.09,0:20:53.51,Puffball,,0,0,0,,I'm here on behalf of my team, Are You Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:54.24,Fanny,,0,0,0,,I'M NOT!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:56.42,Puffball,,0,0,0,,And I'm here to kill your funny plant!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:21:02.94,Tree,,0,0,0,,Well, you might as well give up now, Puffball, because we are the masters at preventing death!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:06.71,Tree,,0,0,0,,Say hello to the castle of the funny plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.71,0:21:11.38,Tree,,0,0,0,,It is impermeable to all the dangers of the rainforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:12.51,Tree,,0,0,0,,From alligators!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.51,0:21:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:14.52,Tree,,0,0,0,,To falling trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:16.55,Tree,,0,0,0,,To snakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.55,0:21:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:18.83,Tree,,0,0,0,,To hurricane winds!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.83,0:21:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.35,0:21:20.40,Tree,,0,0,0,,To fish monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:21.73,Tree,,0,0,0,,To floods!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:22.86,Death P.A.C.T. Again,,0,0,0,,Death P.A.C.T Again: [Gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:27.58,Marker,,0,0,0,,Why didn't we consider that Puffball can just, fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.58,0:21:29.45,Fanny,,0,0,0,,I HATE THE ABILITY TO FLY!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:34.15,Death P.A.C.T. Again,,0,0,0,,Death P.A.C.T Again: GET OUT OF THERE, PUFFBALL! STOP IT, PUFFBALL! WE'RE GOING TO GETCHA!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.15,0:21:38.61,Death P.A.C.T. Again,,0,0,0,,Death P.A.C.T Again: YOU BETTER LEAVE THERE IMMEDIATELY! THIS IS OUR TERRITORY, PB! GET OUT!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.61,0:21:44.91,Tree,,0,0,0,,Black Hole, you're our only flying contestant. You have to fly in there and pull Puffball out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:46.15,Black Hole,,0,0,0,,If you say so!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:56.35,Black Hole,,0,0,0,,Y'know what? I shouldn't get any closer. I could risk sucking up Puffball, and, others--that kills people, so, no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:22:01.43,Tree,,0,0,0,,Black Hole's right...how could we lose sight of our main mission, preventing death!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.43,0:22:07.44,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Well, that may be your strange mantra, but it's not mine! Time for me to eat this silly plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:09.40,Multiple Speakers,,0,0,0,,Remote: But, Puffball!\NPuffball: What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.39,0:22:14.55,Remote,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember Two's rule that if you kill any of the seven funny plants, your team loses?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.55,0:22:17.95,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right! I actually forgot about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.95,0:22:22.17,Fanny,,0,0,0,,Haha! Black Hole couldn't stop you, but Two's arbitrary rule could!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.16,0:22:25.11,Puffball,,0,0,0,,There must still be a way to do something sneaky...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.11,0:22:28.55,Marker,,0,0,0,,Give up, PB! There is not!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:29.94,Puffball,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.93,0:22:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.90,0:22:32.14,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Hey! Ice Cube!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.13,0:22:32.98,Ice Cube,,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:34.33,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Come with me to the jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.33,0:22:35.43,Ice Cube,,0,0,0,,I've got to!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.43,0:22:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.03,0:22:38.87,Marker,,0,0,0,,You're back so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.87,0:22:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.37,0:22:40.15,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Ice Cube screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.16,0:22:41.34,Remote,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.34,0:22:47.78,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Puffball: Here's the answer, Remote. Your funny plant is now absorbing water from Ice Cube's body instead of the soil!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.78,0:22:52.48,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Puffball: She is quickly shriveling up and may die in mere minutes! So the decision is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.47,0:23:00.62,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Puffball: Snip your funny plant to halt the absorption or let Ice Cube wither away into nothingness. You did say your team was all about preventing death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.62,0:23:02.41,Tree,,0,0,0,,Dang! She's clever!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.41,0:23:05.15,Puffball,,0,0,0,,Okay, my job here is done. Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.16,0:23:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:13.37,Cake,,0,0,0,,I'm back with a spoonful of water I found! It was on top of an ancient Yellow Face skeleton hiding in the shade! Here you go, Funny Plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:14.50,Price Tag,,0,0,0,,Wait--Cake! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:16.67,Cake,,0,0,0,,Huh? Price Tag? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.67,0:23:20.38,Nickel,,0,0,0,,Cake, don't you know? Any water that touches Yellow Face's skeleton is...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.38,0:23:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.12,0:23:22.00,Nickel,,0,0,0,,CURSED!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.00,0:23:27.36,Cake,,0,0,0,,What?! I HAD NO IDEA! It's okay though! We can repair the pieces back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:28.75,Two,,0,0,0,,No, you actually can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.75,0:23:30.62,Just Not,,0,0,0,,Just Not: [Scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:34.06,Naily,,0,0,0,,Two, how did you get here? The desert is our biome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.07,0:23:38.20,Two,,0,0,0,,I have a color-changing bracelet so I can teleport to whichever biome I want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.19,0:23:40.64,Price Tag,,0,0,0,,Ooo! That's actually pretty neat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.65,0:23:43.87,Two,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is! Golf Ball's inventions are always so nifty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.87,0:23:50.64,Two,,0,0,0,,But the sad news is that your team, Just Not, is the first to let your funny plant die, so you're all up for elimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.64,0:23:52.28,Just Not,,0,0,0,,Just Not: [Scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.28,0:23:56.92,Cake,,0,0,0,,Aw man, I'm so sorry team! This is all my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.92,0:24:03.94,Book,,0,0,0,,No, Cake, don't say that! It's partly on us BFDIA-ers for not reminding you about that Yellow Face skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.94,0:24:09.89,Cake,,0,0,0,,Also, whoa! Pillow, when did I go from 5 points ahead of you in Yoyle Chess to 30 points behind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.89,0:24:13.94,Pillow,,0,0,0,,That's just one of the consequences of getting cursed by Yellow Face's skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.94,0:24:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.09,0:24:25.73,Snowball,,0,0,0,,Yeah! How's our funny plant now, Basketball? Nice and toasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.72,0:24:30.81,Basketball,,0,0,0,,I mean, it is at a healthy temperature, but I don't feel comfortable with Grassy being on fire right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.82,0:24:34.27,Fanny,,0,0,0,,Guys, our funny plant is sucking up Ice Cube's water! She'll die soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.27,0:24:37.51,Tree,,0,0,0,,And then we'll be responsible for her death through negligence!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.51,0:24:44.74,Robot Flower,,0,0,0,,Um, Grassy's bracelet is nearly completely charred! Do we know what happens when a bracelet gets destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.74,0:24:48.39,Eggy,,0,0,0,,Ha, I bet it'll be fine. When things are set ablaze, they're usually still fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.38,0:24:50.89,Remote,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just pull Ice Cube out?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.89,0:24:56.63,Tree,,0,0,0,,Remember Remote, the walls of our castle are indestructible. If you want to try climbing them, be my guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.63,0:24:57.63,Remote,,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.63,0:24:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.15,0:24:59.46,Remote,,0,0,0,,That was pretty easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.46,0:25:02.00,Tree,,0,0,0,,Nice Job! Now try pulling Ice Cube out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:05.45,Remote,,0,0,0,,Exerting 110% from battery!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.45,0:25:06.77,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Electronic failure noise]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.77,0:25:10.17,Remote,,0,0,0,,I can't do it! Puffball really pushed Ice Cube in deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.16,0:25:14.02,Basketball,,0,0,0,,I don't know Eggy, this whole burning teammate situation is making me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.02,0:25:17.43,Marker,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just take Ice Cube's bracelet off?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.43,0:25:22.86,Fanny,,0,0,0,,No that won't work! She'll be 3 feet underground, and will noclip into the bedrock below, killing her!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.85,0:25:27.83,Basketball,,0,0,0,,If Grassy's bracelet really is about to collapse into ashes, I really have no idea what'll happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.83,0:25:32.26,Tree,,0,0,0,,Maybe we do have to decide between letting our funny plant slowly kill Ice Cube...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.26,0:25:34.30,Fanny,,0,0,0,,Which we absolutely cannot allow!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.30,0:25:36.84,Tree,,0,0,0,,...or killing our funny plant to save Ice Cube!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.84,0:25:41.05,Eggy,,0,0,0,,Um, guys? If this Grassy thing fails, do we have a Plan C?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.04,0:25:43.40,Snowball,,0,0,0,,Hmm... I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.40,0:25:48.17,Eggy,,0,0,0,,What about you Robot Flower? You're the same species as the funny plant. Got any backup plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.17,0:25:52.97,Robot Flower,,0,0,0,,Well, according to Tree, I'm actually NOT the same species.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.97,0:25:54.71,Remote,,0,0,0,,What say you Black Hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.71,0:25:56.88,Black Hole,,0,0,0,,A contestant life is more worth than a plant life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.87,0:25:59.53,Black Hole,,0,0,0,,[Sigh] We just gotta let the plant go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.54,0:26:03.05,Remote,,0,0,0,,But that violates Two's rules. And we'll lose the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.05,0:26:09.40,Black Hole,,0,0,0,,Remote. Don't forget! Our death prevention supersedes any little challenge. EVERY. SINGLE. TIME.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.39,0:26:13.75,Tree,,0,0,0,,Agreed, but how can we kill the plant? We need to snip it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.75,0:26:18.60,Basketball,,0,0,0,,Hey, team?! Grassy's bracelet really is on its last legs now! It's about to crumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.60,0:26:24.60,Marker,,0,0,0,,I've got it! I'll go back to our homeland, and get Two's scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.60,0:26:27.57,Tree,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I remember those, go get 'em Marker!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.57,0:26:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.20,0:26:31.21,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Snatch sound effect]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.21,0:26:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.40,0:26:34.24,Basketball,,0,0,0,,THREE, TWO, ONE!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.24,0:26:36.58,Grassy,,0,0,0,,AHHH! IT'S SO HOT!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.58,0:26:40.10,Multiple Speakers,,0,0,0,,Grassy: AHHH! I'M ON FIRE!\NMarker: AHHH--OW-AHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.10,0:26:51.56,Marker,,0,0,0,,MUST. GET. THE. SCISSORS. TO. MY. TEAMM! WAA...oooo...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.56,0:26:55.36,Tree,,0,0,0,,Wow, nice job Marker. You got the scissors in the nick of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.36,0:26:58.16,Fanny,,0,0,0,,Yes! Now let's snip this funny plant and save Ice Cube!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.16,0:26:59.19,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Snatch sound effect]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.19,0:27:02.92,Tree,,0,0,0,,Funny plant, it's time to DIE!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.92,0:27:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.45,0:27:08.00,Multiple Speakers,,0,0,0,,Ice Cube: Wha?\NRemote: Icy, are you in pain now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.00,0:27:08.74,Ice Cube,,0,0,0,,Ice Cube: No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.74,0:27:10.67,Remote,,0,0,0,,So you're perfectly comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.67,0:27:12.79,Multiple Speakers,,0,0,0,,Ice Cube: Yeah!\NRemote: Hooray! We prevented death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.79,0:27:16.25,Two,,0,0,0,,But Death P.A.C.T. Again, one thing you did not prevent is elimination!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.25,0:27:20.20,Two,,0,0,0,,Because you killed your funny plant, one of your members will leave the show. Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.20,0:27:22.17,Black Hole,,0,0,0,,That was a necessary sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.17,0:27:24.51,Tree,,0,0,0,,Yes, a necessary sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.51,0:27:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.01,0:27:26.54,Tree,,0,0,0,,Yes, a necessary sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.54,0:27:29.14,Fanny,,0,0,0,,None of you noticed that MARKER IS ON FIRE!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.13,0:27:30.46,Tree,,0,0,0,,What the forest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.46,0:27:33.38,Two,,0,0,0,,Wowsers! I better get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.37,0:27:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.42,0:27:42.29,Two,,0,0,0,,Viewers! There are two teams up for elimination! But you only get one vote total, so vote one contestant you want to have saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.29,0:27:50.39,Two,,0,0,0,,The contestant with the fewest votes on Just Not and the contestant with the fewest votes on Death P.A.C.T. Again, will both be eliminated! Make your one vote count!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.38,0:27:54.67,Cary,,0,0,0,,Hello viewers of TPOT 4, thank you for watching the episode! It's me Cary!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.67,0:28:03.24,Cary,,0,0,0,,Y'know, I'm one of the Huang brothers, along with Michael. Um, this is the first BFDI episode I've written in a little while, so it's fun to try it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.24,0:28:09.10,Cary,,0,0,0,, It was a little longer than I expected! Um, it's really rainy outside right now. Gotta film outside where it's lively!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.10,0:28:17.23,Cary,,0,0,0,,Hence, the Outside Lands hoodie. Um, but with that being said, I hope you a had a fun time watching it and I'll see you in TPOT 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.23,0:28:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.53,0:28:26.81,Basketball,,0,0,0,,Ok, now that there's no source of heat, our funny plant will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.82,0:28:27.96,Eggy,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.96,0:28:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.91,0:28:30.92,Eraser,,0,0,0,,Davids smell like boogers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.92,0:28:31.97,Golf Ball,,0,0,0,,Golf Ball: GASP!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.96,0:28:33.36,Eraser,,0,0,0,,What? It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.36,0:28:39.51,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.51,0:28:41.69,Are You Okay,,0,0,0,,Are You Okay: [Scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.69,0:28:45.64,David,,0,0,0,,David: AW, SERIOUSLY?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.64,0:28:48.93,Are You Okay,,0,0,0,,Are You Okay: Woah, ahh! Ooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.93,0:28:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.57,0:28:51.36,SFX,,0,0,0,,[Vomit sounds]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.37,0:28:53.52,Clock,,0,0,0,,Uh oh, did Rocky just barf a second time?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.52,0:28:56.66,Yellow Face,,0,0,0,,He sure did! What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.66,0:28:59.92,Clock,,0,0,0,,Well, pressurized vomit could act as a lens!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.92,0:29:03.41,Yellow Face,,0,0,0,,So, what's the issue with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.40,0:29:08.31,Clock,,0,0,0,,Well, if there's another Gamma Ray burst, the lens can refract it in any number of unpredictable ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.31,0:29:13.27,Yellow Face,,0,0,0,,Funny you say that, because I can see the quasar jiggling up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.27,0:29:14.09,Clock,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.09,0:29:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.24,0:29:23.73,Bottle,,0,0,0,,And now our funny plant is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.73,0:29:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.67,0:29:28.06,Donut,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.06,0:29:34.75,Gaty,,0,0,0,,Gaty: Oh, Donut, it's simple. A Gamma Ray burst came from 2,763 light years away, got refracted by Rocky's vomit--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.75,0:29:38.51,Gaty,,0,0,0,,Gaty: --went right through your mouth and vaporized our funny plant. But, you made it through unscathed!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.51,0:29:42.67,Donut,,0,0,0,,Oh...duh! It's so obvious now that you say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.67,0:29:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.24,0:29:49.94,Bottle,,0,0,0,,And now all the funny plants are dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.94,0:29:58.61,Two,,0,0,0,,Hooray! In one episode of TPOT, we managed to set a rainforest on fire, and cause the complete extinction of a critically-endangered species of funny plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.61,0:30:04.88,Two,,0,0,0,,Aren't I managing TPOT so well? I'm managing it so well! Anyway, see you next episode!
